<h2 id="cold">You already know the moment</h2>
<p>One buyer put it in a sentence I can’t improve:</p>
<blockquote><p>“Last night it was 71 degrees in our house. I had a t-shirt, a sweatshirt, and a fleece jacket on, and a blanket covering me. I was still cold.”</p><cite>Substack, weight-loss forum</cite></blockquote>
